This design is about operations involving a single Fearless project; the location of this Fearless project is the Base16 in scope.
fearlessProject$allPaths is the set of the DeskPaths at Base16 or inside Base16.
fearlessProject$visiblePaths is the set of the DeskPaths of fearlessProject$allPaths where no Segment after Base16 starts with ".".
fearlessProject$fearlessPaths is the set of the paths that Fearless code sees inside Base16; fearlessProject$fearlessPaths includes the paths inside zip files.
The 'name' of a Fearless project is ProjectName when ProjectName ".fearless" is the only file at top level in that Fearless project ending with ".fearless".
fearlessProject$checkWellShaped(Base16) has no Define: fearlessProject$checkWellShaped(Base16) ends with done when the Fearless project at Base16 is 'well shaped' as tasks/FolderShapesDesign defines, and otherwise ends with the Error that a compilation of the Fearless project at Base16 gives.
fearlessProject$fearless_out is the set of the names of the files directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16.
fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "x" creates the empty file x directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16, and fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x" deletes that file.
A modification time is a Time; 0 is before the modification time of every file.
fearlessProject$packages is the list of the PackageNames of the packages of the Fearless project at Base16 other than "base", from the lowest rank.
fearlessProject$lower(PackageName) is the set of "base" and of each PackageName' of fearlessProject$packages where the rank of PackageName' is lower than the rank of PackageName; the code of the package PackageName can use only the packages of fearlessProject$lower(PackageName).
//later: what a package is, and the rank of a package

Grammar:
Time ::= [0-9]+

Define fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate(Base16):
A if "_unfinished.txt" in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
B if "_compile_start.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
C if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)

Define fearlessProject$previousStart(Base16):
A if "_unfinished.txt" in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return 0
B if "_compile_start.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return 0
C action return the modification time of "_compile_start.txt"

Define fearlessProject$compile(Base16):
A action fearlessProject$previousStart(Base16) = Time
B action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "_unfinished.txt"
C action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_compile_start.txt"
D action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "_compile_start.txt"
E action wait until the clock of the file system of Base16 is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt"
F action fearlessProject$checkWellShaped(Base16)
G fact fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
H action fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName1,Time) .. fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageNamen,Time)
I if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorFilesChangedDuringCompile(Base16)
J action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_unfinished.txt"

